<!--
BMT_FAUNA_ABSORPTION_1 - biomesteam.biomescaverns / biomesteam.biomescore /
biomesteam.biomespollutedlands port. Owner ruling 2026-09-11 (question-card
sitting): 38 clean "in" + 30 "move" = 68 unique defNames per
design/Jawa/worldbuilding/review/round2/decisions_propagated.json, with
BMT_ChemSnail's in/out conflict resolved OUT per biome_findings.md (the_rot
departure). Renamed BMT_ -> RSW_ throughout (species, bodies, eggs, leather,
sounds, hediffs, damage types, and every other def pulled in by reference
closure so nothing dangles). Ported verbatim except: modExtensions/comps
whose C# class lives in the retiring BiomesCore.dll / BMT_PollutedLands.dll,
or in PathfindingFramework.*/VEF.AnimalBehaviours.* (neither mod active on
this list), are dropped - the creature keeps its stats/body/art, not the
donor-framework-only behaviour (pack defense hediff, lure-prey AI, filth
trail, water-walker/floating, dig-periodically, custom thing-eater, animal
spawner comps, hermaphroditic-mate job giver, corpse spawner). Two
non-resident adult forms (RSW_RoyalRhino, RSW_ShatterjawBeetle) are ported
as back-end evolveIntoPawnKindDef targets for their resident larva/pupa
stages, decided "out" for biome residency but required for the vanilla
evolve mechanism not to dangle - not added to any biome cast.
Texture texPaths repathed to swanimals/BiomesTeam/<original path>, files
copied verbatim from the donor mods' own Textures trees.

-->
